In [[:Category:Venice, Italy|Venice]], [[DeFoe]] used Simplemind on a freaked out [[gondolier]] who had seen [[Titans]], ordering him to forget everything he had witnessed. {{source|A Seeker Is Born}} 

In [[:Category:Rouen, France|Rouen]], [[Zhalia Moon]] used Simplemind against a police officer to make [[Peter]] escape. {{Source|Into the River of Secrets}} 

In the [[Paris Catacombs]], Zhalia used the spell against [[Mr. MacTavish]], who had guessed her identity because of her powers. {{source|Divide and Conquer}} 

In the [[:Category:Valley of the Kings, Egypt|Valley of the Kings]], Zhalia used Simplemind to knock [[Unnamed Suit 036]] unconscious and steal his map of the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]]. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}.

In [[:Category:Paris, France|Paris]], Zhalia used the spell to wipe out a whole family' memory, after they witnessed Titans breaking out of the [[Cathedral of Notre Dame]] and asked for explanations. Lok then remarked that Simplemind would be useful to make the [[Blood Spiral]] forget about their nefarious goals, but Zhalia disproved him by explaining that the spell isn't very effective on Seekers. {{source|The Legendary Titan of Fate}}

In [[Lambert house]], [[Dante Vale]] used the spell on [[Kathy Lambert]] after she saw the Huntik team using their powers. {{source|Back Home}}

